283853221684694,0.022444652393460274,0.014846183359622955,0.010867019183933735,0.030856404453516006,0.005437131971120834,0.011739459820091724,0.00962812453508377,0.008498326875269413,0.0018078468274325132,0.01036904938519001,-0.013917305506765842,-0.020207324996590614,0.002558551263064146,-0.02105882577598095,0.012259497307240963,-0.01745598204433918,0.0006866002804599702,0.012465768493711948,0.03128195181488991,-0.026665078476071358,Multimodal Interaction Augmentation,"LLMs often struggle to consistently understand diverse and multifaceted user queries that encompass multiple languages and modalities (e.g., speech, images), leading to ambiguities in discerning actual user intent.","User interactions involving varied input types beyond pure text, such as spoken commands, images, or foreign languages.","Deploy specialized tools like speech recognition, image analysis, or machine translator tools to significantly enhance the perceptual capabilities of LLMs.","Improved understanding and response to a broader spectrum of user inputs, optimizing dialogue management and intent recognition, and enabling LLMs to manage intricate user interactions more effectively.","Understanding speech inputs, analyzing images, translating languages, enhancing linguistic understanding for dialogue management.","The Multimodal Interaction Augmentation pattern addresses the challenge of Large Language Models (LLMs) struggling to understand diverse user queries spanning multiple languages and modalities. It solves this by deploying specialized tools such as speech recognition, image analysis, or machine translators to enhance the LLM's perceptual capabilities. This approach results in improved understanding and response to a broader spectrum of user inputs, optimizing dialogue management and intent recognition for more effective human-AI interactions."
