681861657649279,0.015851829200983047,0.002946928609162569,0.010987063869833946,-0.016846900805830956,0.01438104547560215,0.004327769391238689,-0.002677333075553179,-0.002508770441636443,-0.004369892179965973,-0.019318578764796257,-0.02492089383304119,-0.011026725172996521,-0.02192174457013607,0.002578142797574401,-0.006135257426649332,-7.974832988111302e-05,0.02571387030184269,0.03368840739130974,-0.029195478186011314,Decomposed Prompting (DecomP),"Large Language Models (LLMs) struggle to directly solve complex reasoning tasks in a single, monolithic step.","Complex tasks that can be naturally broken down into a series of smaller, more manageable subtasks.","Prompts LLMs to explicitly decompose the overall reasoning task into a sequence of subtasks. The LLM then solves each subtask step-by-step, building towards the final solution.","Simplifies complex tasks for LLMs, making them more tractable and improving the accuracy of the final solution by addressing each component individually.","Multi-step problem-solving, complex question answering, task automation involving sequential operations.","Decomposed Prompting (DecomP) is an AI pattern designed to help Large Language Models (LLMs) overcome their struggle with directly solving complex reasoning tasks in a single step. It works by explicitly prompting the LLM to break down the overall problem into a sequence of smaller, more manageable subtasks, which are then solved step-by-step. This systematic decomposition simplifies complex challenges, making them more tractable for LLMs and improving the accuracy of the final solution."
