768212795,0.010981054045259953,0.025051239877939224,0.005383106879889965,0.02373134344816208,-0.0072379750199615955,0.011860014870762825,0.0056726932525634766,0.005823964718729258,0.014955243095755577,-0.014983043074607849,-0.027365708723664284,-0.016250111162662506,0.008153325878083706,-0.007925866171717644,-0.0004896721802651882,-0.013620500452816486,-0.008972873911261559,0.03182971850037575,0.03506147116422653,-0.02767353691160679,Intent Understanding,"User queries are often imprecise, vague, or polysemous, making it challenging for AI systems to accurately infer the user's intended meaning and map it to specific actions or tool functionalities.","Any AI system, especially those interacting with users via natural language, where the system needs to perform tasks based on user instructions. This is particularly critical in tool learning where user intent must be translated into tool calls.","Leverage foundation models' strong language understanding capabilities, often enhanced by instruction tuning. This involves training models on diverse instructions to generalize to unseen tasks and potentially interacting with users to clarify ambiguities. Personalized tool learning can further adapt to individual user expression styles.","More accurate interpretation of user goals, personalized responses, and improved user experience by reducing cognitive load on the user.","Natural language interfaces for tool learning, dialogue systems, task automation based on user commands.","The Intent Understanding AI pattern addresses the challenge of accurately inferring a user's true meaning from their often imprecise or ambiguous natural language queries. It leverages powerful foundation models, enhanced by instruction tuning, to generalize understanding across diverse tasks, often clarifying ambiguities or adapting to individual user styles. This results in more accurate interpretation of user goals, personalized responses, and an improved user experience by reducing their cognitive load."
