266951561,0.01759234443306923,0.024080444127321243,-0.007723390124738216,0.0014957404928281903,-0.0023671218659728765,0.012969523668289185,0.0003375388914719224,0.005432765930891037,0.007050829939544201,-0.020018480718135834,0.002852423582226038,-0.026930376887321472,0.014978120103478432,-0.01838509738445282,0.005366378929466009,-0.0017703718040138483,0.013652198947966099,0.01223763544112444,0.023754864931106567,-0.007910704240202904,Interactive Tool Use Trajectory Curation,Training tool-integrated agents is challenging due to the absence of interactive tool-use annotations in existing mathematical reasoning datasets.,Preparing high-quality training data for LLMs designed to perform tool-integrated reasoning.,"Utilize a powerful LLM (e.g., GPT4) to synthesize interactive tool-use trajectories. This involves crafting detailed prompts with few-shot examples demonstrating the interleaved rationale-program-output format, then using the LLM with greedy decoding and nucleus sampling to generate trajectories, filtering for correct answers and absence of tool-use errors.","Creation of TORACORPUS, a dataset of 16k high-quality interactive tool-use annotations for mathematical problems (GSM8k and MATH), enabling the training of TORA models.","Generating synthetic, interactive tool-use training data for LLMs when human-annotated datasets are unavailable or insufficient.","Interactive Tool Use Trajectory Curation addresses the challenge of training tool-integrated LLMs by generating synthetic data when human annotations are scarce. It employs a powerful LLM, such as GPT-4, to synthesize detailed interactive tool-use trajectories through carefully crafted few-shot prompts and specific decoding strategies. These generated trajectories are then rigorously filtered for correctness and absence of errors, producing high-quality datasets like TORACORPUS to enable the training of more capable tool-using agents."
