36805296689272,-0.007601248100399971,0.010714702308177948,-0.015370267443358898,0.010201869532465935,0.006282038986682892,0.0016791049856692553,0.0029278986621648073,-0.008726371452212334,-0.01762996055185795,-0.011892124079167843,-0.004897831007838249,-0.022820839658379555,-0.00018238299526274204,0.0030512134544551373,-0.0017067071748897433,0.030102670192718506,0.03787064552307129,-0.030456675216555595,Chain-of-Thought (CoT) Prompting,"Large Language Models (LLMs) often struggle with complex multi-step reasoning tasks, leading to incorrect or superficial answers when prompted directly.","Improving the reasoning capabilities of LLMs, particularly for tasks requiring logical deduction or step-by-step problem-solving.",Instruct the LLM to generate a series of intermediate reasoning steps or a 'thought process' in natural language before providing the final answer. This guides the model through the problem-solving process.,"Elicits more robust and accurate reasoning, allowing LLMs to tackle more complex problems by breaking them down into manageable sub-problems. Improves performance on mathematical reasoning and other complex language tasks.",Enhancing LLM performance on complex reasoning tasks by making the model's thought process explicit and sequential.,"Chain-of-Thought (CoT) Prompting is an AI pattern that instructs a Large Language Model (LLM) to generate a series of intermediate reasoning steps in natural language before providing a final answer. This method addresses the challenge of LLMs struggling with complex multi-step reasoning tasks when prompted directly. By explicitly guiding the model through a step-by-step thought process, CoT prompting elicits more robust and accurate reasoning, significantly improving performance on intricate problems."
