5,-0.013201785273849964,0.0035899081267416477,0.022598905488848686,-0.007502048742026091,0.006696701981127262,-0.000933137140236795,0.010038938373327255,0.003951874561607838,0.006130741909146309,0.006135181523859501,-0.010504183359444141,-0.014916068874299526,-0.017942480742931366,0.0057196966372430325,-0.026142366230487823,0.007872279733419418,0.00354039017111063,0.013894164934754372,0.01772342249751091,0.040263742208480835,-0.02693074382841587,Tool Augmentation,"Large Language Models (LLMs) suffer from challenges such as hallucination, weak numerical reasoning, and lack of access to up-to-date or specific external knowledge.","LLMs possess vast internal knowledge from pretraining but have inherent limitations in factual accuracy, numerical computation, and real-time information access.","Enhance LLMs' capabilities by integrating them with external specialized tools such as retrieval systems, math tools (e.g., WolframAlpha), code interpreters (e.g., Python, SQL), and structured databases.","Improves LLMs' question-answering abilities, mitigates hallucinations by providing verified information, and enhances numerical and logical reasoning by offloading tasks to specialized systems.","Enhancing factual accuracy, improving numerical reasoning, accessing real-time data, solving domain-specific problems.","Tool Augmentation addresses the inherent limitations of Large Language Models, such as hallucination, weak numerical reasoning, and lack of real-time external knowledge. It achieves this by integrating LLMs with specialized external tools like retrieval systems, math tools, and code interpreters. This integration significantly enhances LLMs' factual accuracy, improves numerical and logical reasoning, and mitigates hallucinations by leveraging verified information and specialized computation."
