021099,0.017882976680994034,-0.012068131938576698,0.002645518397912383,0.016784535720944405,0.0026700664311647415,0.003541573416441679,-0.01603081077337265,0.008855747058987617,0.006703501101583242,0.017806697636842728,0.009987717494368553,-0.021128863096237183,-0.019735142588615417,-0.022277124226093292,0.01626874879002571,-0.014446274377405643,-0.0034525988157838583,-0.005982646718621254,0.009511393494904041,0.030944114550948143,0.03997832164168358,-0.0256405808031559,FewShot Prompting,GenAIs need to learn skills and tasks with limited examples without weight updates.,When training data is unavailable or model parameters cannot be updated.,Provide the GenAI with a few examples (exemplars) of a task being completed within the prompt.,"The GenAI learns to complete the task, often improving model performance, especially in larger models.","Task completion, classification, question answering.","FewShot Prompting is a prompt design technique where Generative AIs learn new skills and tasks from a limited number of examples without requiring model weight updates. This is achieved by providing several ""exemplars"" of the task directly within the prompt, allowing the AI to infer the desired behavior. As a result, the GenAI can effectively complete tasks like classification or question answering, often leading to improved performance, particularly in larger models."
