19795668125,0.0071094706654548645,0.014841156080365181,0.001864513847976923,0.02623194083571434,-0.014046666212379932,0.00020704111375380307,-0.005856434348970652,0.016801629215478897,0.007192592136561871,-0.01283201016485691,-0.020475005730986595,-0.015664394944906235,0.018801510334014893,-0.013272362761199474,0.0022441637702286243,-0.006398545578122139,-0.00505105359479785,0.014064873568713665,0.031106792390346527,-0.018978286534547806,ZeroShot Prompting,Guiding GenAIs to complete tasks without any examples.,"When no exemplars are available or desired, and only an instruction in natural language is given to the model.","Provide a prompt with zero exemplars, relying solely on instructions to guide the GenAI's output.",The GenAI performs the task based on its pre-trained knowledge and the given instructions.,"Open-ended tasks, initial task exploration, when no examples are available.","ZeroShot Prompting is an AI pattern designed to guide Generative AIs to complete tasks without providing any examples. It relies solely on natural language instructions within the prompt, leveraging the model's pre-trained knowledge to understand and execute the request. This approach is particularly useful for open-ended tasks, initial explorations, or when no exemplars are available to demonstrate the desired output."
