299909859895706,0.01783962920308113,0.01235247403383255,4.366688881418668e-05,0.015489129349589348,-0.006488482933491468,0.005526409950107336,-0.0035768139641731977,0.011504770256578922,0.0080867949873209,-0.014976800419390202,-0.021539216861128807,-0.021859213709831238,0.012633617036044598,-0.009346527978777885,0.005403854884207249,-0.011856901459395885,-0.010703212581574917,0.0329020656645298,0.030477292835712433,-0.01895466260612011,Role Prompting,Achieving more desirable outputs or improving accuracy for open-ended tasks by influencing the GenAI's persona.,"When the desired output style, tone, or content can be enhanced by assigning a specific persona to the GenAI.","Assign a specific role or persona to the GenAI within the prompt (e.g., 'Pretend you are a shepherd').",Creates more desirable outputs for open-ended tasks and can improve accuracy on benchmarks.,"Content generation, creative writing, specific domain interactions.","Role Prompting is an AI pattern where a specific role or persona is assigned to the Generative AI within the prompt, such as ""Pretend you are a shepherd."" This technique aims to achieve more desirable outputs and improve accuracy for open-ended tasks by influencing the AI's persona, especially when the desired output style, tone, or content can be enhanced by such an assignment. The result is the creation of more tailored and desirable outputs for applications like content generation and creative writing, often leading to improved accuracy on benchmarks."
