.0041829925030469894,0.004984713159501553,-0.0065485150553286076,0.012740502133965492,-0.003673732280731201,0.008785570040345192,-0.0015440834686160088,-0.0018584677018225193,0.003434256184846163,-0.009688908234238625,-0.01584838330745697,-0.017637284472584724,0.015603902749717236,-0.01838614046573639,-0.012462201528251171,0.004012120887637138,-0.011219518259167671,0.022304130718111992,0.03133135661482811,-0.02010134607553482,SimToM,"Answering complicated questions involving multiple people or objects, where establishing facts known by specific entities is crucial.",When a question requires understanding different perspectives or knowledge states of various entities mentioned in the prompt.,"Given the question, the LLM first attempts to establish the set of facts one person knows, then answers the question based only on those facts. This is a two-prompt process.",Helps eliminate the effect of irrelevant information and improves reasoning in complex scenarios.,"Complex question answering, multi-entity reasoning.","SimToM (Simulated Theory of Mind) is an AI pattern designed to answer complex questions by understanding the distinct knowledge states or perspectives of multiple entities. It employs a two-prompt process where the Large Language Model first establishes the facts known by a specific person and then answers the question based solely on that isolated information. This approach effectively eliminates irrelevant details and significantly improves reasoning in intricate, multi-entity scenarios."
