1,0.004193683620542288,0.005925883539021015,0.019554318860173225,-0.014668668620288372,0.009969071485102177,-0.006668771617114544,0.004461413249373436,0.007856534793972969,-0.005803653039038181,-0.016994409263134003,-0.015556519851088524,-0.003054119413718581,-0.01760934293270111,-0.0008208989747799933,-0.0004497056652326137,-0.004836124833673239,0.024917328730225563,0.042562056332826614,-0.0229618139564991,StepBack Prompting,Improving reasoning performance on complex problems by focusing on high-level concepts first.,When a problem requires understanding underlying concepts or facts before detailed reasoning.,"First, ask the LLM a generic, high-level question about relevant concepts or facts before delving into the specific problem's reasoning.",Improved performance significantly on multiple reasoning benchmarks.,"Complex reasoning tasks, abstract problem-solving.",StepBack Prompting is an AI pattern designed to improve reasoning performance on complex problems by initially focusing on high-level concepts. It works by first asking the Large Language Model (LLM) a generic question about relevant underlying concepts or facts before delving into the specific problem's detailed reasoning. This approach is effective for abstract problem-solving and has demonstrated significant performance improvements on multiple reasoning benchmarks.
