6826484203,-0.015786662697792053,0.004240570589900017,0.006861600559204817,-0.008700369857251644,0.013270961120724678,-0.010941718704998493,0.00900812353938818,0.001350155915133655,-0.0032708407379686832,0.0036784587427973747,-0.015313210897147655,-0.02260204590857029,-0.008624454960227013,0.004570042714476585,-0.02373003400862217,0.0005245372303761542,0.006549094803631306,-0.003378545865416527,0.02141684852540493,0.04321952164173126,-0.019694561138749123,Analogical Prompting,Generating effective ChainofThought exemplars automatically for mathematical reasoning and code generation.,When CoT exemplars are needed but manual creation is time-consuming or difficult.,"Automatically generate exemplars that include ChainofThoughts, similar to Self-Generated InContext Learning.",Demonstrated improvements in mathematical reasoning and code generation tasks.,"Automating CoT exemplar creation, improving reasoning and code generation.","Analogical Prompting is an AI pattern designed to automatically generate effective Chain-of-Thought (CoT) exemplars, addressing the difficulty and time consumption of manual creation for tasks like mathematical reasoning and code generation. Its solution involves automatically creating these CoT exemplars, drawing conceptual similarity to Self-Generated In-Context Learning. This approach has demonstrated significant improvements in performance for both mathematical reasoning and code generation tasks."
