1305,0.0073139844462275505,5.708958997274749e-05,-0.0019270234042778611,-0.02444162406027317,0.007430265657603741,0.0023887301795184612,0.004442539531737566,0.004098191857337952,-0.011653373017907143,-0.02000962570309639,-0.009477127343416214,0.00555867375805974,-0.02844315581023693,-6.724878767272457e-05,0.009352674707770348,0.011634818278253078,0.016995303332805634,0.043031323701143265,-0.02468482218682766,Automatic ChainofThought (AutoCoT) Prompting,Automatically generating chains of thought to build FewShot CoT prompts.,"When manual creation of CoT exemplars is burdensome, and an automated approach is desired.",Use a ZeroShot prompt to automatically generate chains of thought. These generated CoTs are then used to build a FewShot CoT prompt for a test sample.,"Automates the creation of CoT exemplars, simplifying FewShot CoT implementation.","Automating CoT exemplar creation, scaling FewShot CoT applications.","Automatic Chain-of-Thought (AutoCoT) Prompting automates the creation of Chain-of-Thought (CoT) exemplars, addressing the burden of manual generation for few-shot prompting. It achieves this by using a zero-shot prompt to automatically generate CoTs, which are then used to construct a few-shot CoT prompt for a test sample. This method simplifies and scales the implementation of few-shot CoT applications by automating the entire exemplar creation process."
