02092992514371872,-0.001135786296799779,0.0022095574531704187,-0.0033884793519973755,0.011612212285399437,-0.012282046489417553,0.006321363151073456,-0.0008841811213642359,0.001136130653321743,0.006538222078233957,-0.006540541537106037,-0.013600294478237629,-0.01575457863509655,0.007915010675787926,-0.02142399363219738,-0.00982262659817934,0.005717668682336807,0.00366658135317266,0.022143768146634102,0.02412673458456993,-0.03599248826503754,SelfVerification,Scoring multiple candidate solutions generated with ChainofThought to select the best one.,"When multiple CoT solutions are generated, and a method is needed to evaluate their quality.",Generate multiple candidate solutions with ChainofThought (CoT). Score each solution by masking certain parts of the original question and asking an LLM to predict them based on the rest of the question and the generated solution.,Shown improvement on eight reasoning datasets by selecting more reliable solutions.,"Improving reasoning accuracy, selecting optimal solutions from multiple candidates.","SelfVerification is an AI pattern designed to evaluate and select the most reliable solution from multiple candidates generated using Chain-of-Thought (CoT). It operates by generating several CoT solutions, then scoring each one by having a Large Language Model (LLM) predict masked parts of the original question based on the solution and the remaining question context. This process has shown to improve reasoning accuracy across various datasets by effectively identifying and selecting optimal solutions."
