75898677110672,0.015542982146143913,-0.005496513564139605,0.025968965142965317,-0.014973240904510021,0.00770478555932641,-0.00329588376916945,0.011023836210370064,0.0052678086794912815,-0.009184056892991066,-0.01989290677011013,-0.014608608558773994,0.005772012751549482,-0.01539523620158434,-0.001577633200213313,-0.003319400828331709,-0.013031180948019028,0.029862258583307266,0.039137206971645355,-0.014713319018483162,Meta Prompting,Automatically generating or improving prompts and prompt templates.,"When manual prompt engineering is time-consuming, or there's a need to automate prompt creation/refinement.",Prompt an LLM to generate or improve a prompt or prompt template. This can be done with a simple template or more complex uses with multiple iterations and scoring mechanisms.,"Automates prompt engineering, leading to potentially better prompts.","Automated prompt generation, prompt optimization.","Meta Prompting is an AI pattern where a Large Language Model (LLM) is used to generate or refine other prompts or prompt templates. This approach addresses the time-consuming nature of manual prompt engineering by automating the creation and optimization process, which can range from simple template generation to complex iterative refinement with scoring mechanisms. Ultimately, Meta Prompting streamlines prompt engineering, leading to more efficient and potentially higher-quality prompts for various generative AI applications."
