1,-0.007664444390684366,0.015635309740900993,0.006821570917963982,0.0021493970416486263,0.01645902544260025,-0.012358824722468853,0.00921618938446045,-0.007599534932523966,0.01155948918312788,-0.0068705081939697266,-0.007923856377601624,-0.02540331333875656,-0.014434956945478916,0.023206956684589386,-0.018064510077238083,0.004871123004704714,-0.005078878719359636,-0.0037009522784501314,0.014367768540978432,0.03831278160214424,-0.015502259135246277,Automatic Prompt Engineer (APE),Automatically generating and optimizing ZeroShot instruction prompts.,"When a set of exemplars is available, and an optimal ZeroShot instruction prompt needs to be found iteratively.","Use a set of exemplars to generate a ZeroShot instruction prompt. Generate multiple possible prompts, score them, then create variations of the best ones (e.g., by using prompt paraphrasing). Iterate on this process until some desiderata are reached.",Automatically generates and refines effective instruction prompts.,"Automated prompt optimization, prompt discovery.","The Automatic Prompt Engineer (APE) pattern automates the generation and optimization of ZeroShot instruction prompts. It operates by iteratively creating, scoring, and refining multiple prompt variations based on a set of exemplars, often employing techniques like prompt paraphrasing. This process continues until an effective prompt is discovered, streamlining the search for optimal instructions for a given task."
