0.014806045219302177,-0.002981015481054783,0.010088367387652397,-0.009646960534155369,-0.004236740525811911,-0.004341003950685263,0.01345202885568142,-0.0030885820742696524,-0.007055350579321384,-0.020996706560254097,-0.01711978204548359,-6.909584044478834e-06,-0.01781022921204567,0.005833163391798735,-0.01654861867427826,0.0006726848660036922,0.015309368260204792,0.04260401800274849,-0.02302265539765358,Translate First Prompting,"Improving output quality of GenAIs in non-English languages, especially low-resource languages, due to English-centric training.","When interacting with GenAIs in languages other than English, where performance disparities exist.","First translate non-English input examples into English using an external MT system, multilingual LMs, or LLMs. The model then processes the English input.","The model can utilize its strengths in English to better understand the content, improving performance in non-English settings.","Machine translation, cross-lingual task performance.","Translate First Prompting addresses the challenge of improving GenAI output quality in non-English languages, especially low-resource ones, where models often underperform due to English-centric training. The pattern works by first translating any non-English input examples into English using an external machine translation system or a multilingual language model. This allows the GenAI to process the input in its strongest language, leveraging its English capabilities for better understanding and improved performance in non-English contexts."
