9552,0.018019933253526688,-0.0035427010152488947,0.02058332785964012,-0.01647893898189068,0.011024964042007923,-0.003978186286985874,0.006525220349431038,0.0041497149504721165,-0.006426236592233181,-0.026117388159036636,-0.013410286046564579,0.0026190083008259535,-0.03078768402338028,-0.001229363027960062,-0.0029420885257422924,0.0007486803806386888,0.024999188259243965,0.03475147858262062,-0.03012700006365776,XLT Cross-Lingual Thought Prompting,Extending ChainofThought (CoT) prompting to multilingual settings.,When applying CoT reasoning to tasks in multiple languages.,"Utilize a prompt template composed of six separate instructions, including role assignment, cross-lingual thinking, and CoT.",Extends the benefits of CoT to multilingual contexts.,"Multilingual reasoning tasks, cross-lingual problem-solving.","XLT Cross-Lingual Thought Prompting is an AI pattern designed to extend the benefits of Chain-of-Thought (CoT) reasoning to tasks in multilingual settings. It achieves this by utilizing a six-part prompt template that includes instructions for role assignment, explicit cross-lingual thinking, and CoT steps. This approach effectively enables robust reasoning and problem-solving across multiple languages, building upon existing CoT methods."
