23137103766203,-0.0006949997041374445,0.009339282289147377,-0.01779521442949772,0.011080676689743996,0.0011736524756997824,0.004107196815311909,0.009588980115950108,-0.005575251765549183,-0.027136214077472687,-0.009365513920783997,0.011463969014585018,-0.018593765795230865,-0.0020534666255116463,-0.007019602693617344,0.0012359387474134564,0.019479507580399513,0.042815424501895905,-0.032593294978141785,Cross-Lingual Self Consistent Prompting (CLSP),Improving multilingual CoT reasoning through ensembling across languages.,When seeking to enhance the robustness and accuracy of CoT reasoning in multilingual settings.,Introduce an ensemble technique that constructs reasoning paths in different languages to answer the same question.,Enhances multilingual CoT performance through cross-lingual ensembling.,"Multilingual reasoning, robust cross-lingual problem-solving.",Cross-Lingual Self Consistent Prompting (CLSP) is an AI pattern designed to enhance the robustness and accuracy of multilingual Chain-of-Thought (CoT) reasoning. It achieves this by employing an ensemble technique where the same question is answered by constructing independent reasoning paths in various languages. This cross-lingual ensembling approach significantly improves multilingual CoT performance and provides more robust problem-solving capabilities.
