7691984177,0.020785901695489883,-6.159106851555407e-05,0.009036594070494175,-0.03547088801860809,0.008506608195602894,-0.007198045961558819,0.008446966297924519,-0.002462536096572876,-0.005800479091703892,-0.024123268201947212,-0.01176410261541605,0.003470966126769781,-0.026133928447961807,0.00921164732426405,-0.014945551753044128,0.0032753045670688152,0.01779722049832344,0.03931693732738495,-0.026443500071763992,Decomposed Prompting for MT (DecoMT),Translating long source texts accurately by handling them in chunks.,When translating long source texts where context management and consistency are challenging.,"Divide the source text into several chunks and translate them independently using fewshot prompting. Then, use these translations and contextual information between chunks to generate a final translation.",Improves translation of long texts by breaking them into manageable parts and maintaining context.,"Machine translation of long documents, maintaining consistency across translated segments.","Decomposed Prompting for MT (DecoMT) is an AI pattern designed to accurately translate long source texts, especially when managing context and consistency across extensive content is challenging. Its solution involves dividing the source text into independent chunks, translating each using few-shot prompting, and then synthesizing these translations with inter-chunk contextual information to generate a final output. This method effectively improves the translation of lengthy documents by making them manageable and maintaining consistency across all translated segments."
