9499836,0.0004548884753603488,0.024688009172677994,0.01985267363488674,0.003708051750436425,0.01959327422082424,-0.016312576830387115,-0.00010584640403976664,-0.0033249135594815016,0.008966640569269657,-0.005147532559931278,-0.006034394260495901,-0.02597186155617237,-0.00951026938855648,0.005835473537445068,-0.03000497817993164,0.008701477199792862,-0.010900464840233326,0.009625577367842197,0.0185659509152174,0.03669687733054161,-0.019349612295627594,Iterative Prompting (for MT),Refining draft translations by integrating human feedback or automated retrieval signals.,When an initial draft translation needs further improvement and quality assurance.,Prompt LLMs to create a draft translation. This initial version is further refined by integrating supervision signals obtained from either automated retrieval systems or direct human feedback.,Produces more refined and accurate translations through iterative human or automated supervision.,"High-quality machine translation, post-editing assistance.","Iterative Prompting (for MT) is an AI-Human Interaction pattern designed to refine initial draft translations generated by Large Language Models. It operates by generating an initial translation draft, which is then iteratively improved through the integration of supervision signals from either human feedback or automated retrieval systems. This iterative supervision process ultimately yields more refined and accurate translations, particularly valuable for high-quality machine translation and post-editing assistance."
