7400546074,-0.0020433992613106966,0.025428995490074158,-0.012722170911729336,0.011714152991771698,0.0013390557141974568,0.011230163276195526,0.007495217490941286,-0.031866174191236496,-0.02352222613990307,-0.016256775707006454,0.00626344233751297,-0.020467495545744896,0.004957866854965687,-0.016668081283569336,0.0005254846182651818,0.041215814650058746,0.03661666810512543,-0.0010028566466644406,Negative Prompting,"Preventing the generation of undesired elements in multimodal outputs (e.g., images).","When generating images or other multimodal content, and specific undesirable features might appear.","Numerically weight certain terms in the prompt so that the model considers them less heavily than others. For example, negatively weighting 'bad hands' to avoid anatomically inaccurate hands.",Models are more likely to generate outputs without the negatively weighted elements.,"Image generation, multimodal content creation, fine-tuning generative outputs.","Negative Prompting is a generative AI pattern used to prevent the inclusion of specific undesired elements in multimodal outputs, such as images. It achieves this by numerically weighting certain terms in the prompt less heavily, effectively telling the model what *not* to generate—for instance, negatively weighting ""bad hands"" to avoid anatomical inaccuracies. This process results in models being more likely to produce outputs free from these negatively weighted features, thereby fine-tuning the generative process."
