096395924687386,0.002388178603723645,0.00165803381241858,-0.006988792214542627,0.0031291800551116467,-0.005291678477078676,0.007061697077006102,0.002671598456799984,0.008428903296589851,0.010177589021623135,-0.022013820707798004,-0.006348048336803913,-0.017604267224669456,-0.004488605074584484,-0.014466367661952972,0.009213325567543507,-0.01619364507496357,0.01577693782746792,0.04292008653283119,0.030685681849718094,0.0061905221082270145,PairedImage Prompting,Demonstrating image transformations to a model for it to perform similar conversions on new images.,"When an image transformation task needs to be learned by example, similar to few-shot learning for text.","Show the model two images: one before and one after some transformation. Then, present the model with a new image for which it will perform the demonstrated conversion. This can be done with or without textual instructions.",Enables the model to learn and apply image transformations from examples.,"Image editing, style transfer, visual transformations.","PairedImage Prompting is an AI technique for teaching models how to perform specific image transformations by providing visual examples. It works by presenting the model with a ""before"" and ""after"" image pair, demonstrating a desired conversion, and then asking it to apply that same transformation to a new input image. This method enables models to learn and execute various visual changes, such as image editing or style transfer, based on the provided examples."
