9871900975704,-0.012648658826947212,0.005729484837502241,0.014620695263147354,0.0029320726171135902,0.022170623764395714,-7.658241520402953e-05,0.007218201644718647,-0.005278765689581633,0.012393984943628311,0.007893867790699005,-0.014792888425290585,-0.024669408798217773,-0.018931828439235687,-0.004891989286988974,-0.020521093159914017,-0.003166154958307743,-0.016668591648340225,0.015024002641439438,0.02170874923467636,0.02918280102312565,-0.016664978116750717,ImageasText Prompting,Including images or multiple images easily within a text-based prompt.,"When multimodal prompts are needed, but the primary interaction is text-based.","Generate a textual description of an image, which then allows for the easy inclusion of the image (or multiple images) in a text-based prompt.",Facilitates multimodal prompting by converting visual information into a text-compatible format.,"Multimodal reasoning, image captioning, integrating visual context into text prompts.","ImageasText Prompting is an AI pattern designed to integrate visual information into text-based prompts by converting images into textual descriptions. It achieves this by generating a detailed textual description of an single or multiple images, effectively transforming visual data into a format compatible with text-only inputs. This approach facilitates multimodal reasoning and other tasks by enabling the seamless inclusion of visual context within a primarily text-based interaction framework."
