,0.019950630143284798,-0.010038829408586025,0.014600536786019802,0.01400205958634615,-0.016752880066633224,0.013430308550596237,-0.0033257107716053724,0.005984215531498194,-0.010217664763331413,0.0011398813221603632,0.012331701815128326,-0.02645615115761757,-0.021681949496269226,-0.024923525750637054,0.006508640479296446,-0.012809136882424355,0.002873428165912628,-0.019364390522241592,-0.004453871864825487,0.02873934619128704,0.01860114373266697,-0.0004958778154104948,Segmentation Prompting,"Performing segmentation tasks (e.g., semantic segmentation) using prompts.",When a model needs to identify and delineate specific objects or regions within an image.,Use prompts to guide the model in performing segmentation tasks.,Enables flexible and prompt-driven segmentation.,"Image segmentation, computer vision tasks.","Segmentation Prompting is an AI pattern focused on performing segmentation tasks, like identifying and delineating specific objects or regions within an image, by using prompts to guide the model. This method leverages prompts to direct the model's execution, enabling it to accurately segment desired elements within a given visual context. The result is a flexible and prompt-driven approach for image segmentation and various computer vision applications."
