5654736,0.02344318851828575,0.011100638657808304,0.018965240567922592,0.0061186240054667,0.01393001526594162,-0.007682346273213625,0.011753791011869907,0.0025579005014151335,-0.0010674307122826576,-0.022276336327195168,-0.021284451708197594,0.028859391808509827,-0.016726704314351082,-0.01228530053049326,0.007738448679447174,0.0025413455441594124,0.018254248425364494,0.035497743636369705,-0.027008894830942154,"Modular Reasoning, Knowledge and Language (MRKL) System","Allowing LLMs to make use of external systems for tasks like mathematical computations, reasoning, and factuality.",When LLMs have shortcomings in specific areas and can benefit from external tools.,"Contains an LLM router providing access to multiple tools (e.g., calculator, weather API). The router makes multiple calls to get information and combines it to generate a final response.","Extends LLM capabilities by integrating external tools, improving accuracy and factuality.","Complex problem-solving, factual question answering, real-world interaction.","The Modular Reasoning, Knowledge and Language (MRKL) System is an agentic AI pattern designed to overcome LLM shortcomings by integrating external tools for tasks like computation, reasoning, and factuality. It operates via an LLM router that provides access to multiple specialized tools (e.g., calculators, APIs), making iterative calls to gather and combine information. This approach significantly extends LLM capabilities, improving accuracy and factuality for complex problem-solving and real-world interactions."
