85910797,0.013028769753873348,0.02555670775473118,0.0051382360979914665,0.040869612246751785,-0.007698290050029755,0.031439363956451416,0.0003775092773139477,-0.000689176726154983,0.007898954674601555,-0.01259425189346075,-0.001110290177166462,-0.02672806940972805,0.02126823365688324,-0.017242027446627617,-0.009439677000045776,0.009601706638932228,0.004660351201891899,0.017288727685809135,0.017844440415501595,-0.010399025864899158,Voyager,Enabling agents to acquire new skills and explore open-world environments through self-directed learning.,"When an agent needs to operate in complex, open-ended environments (e.g., Minecraft) and continuously learn new skills.",Composed of three parts: 1. Proposes tasks for itself to complete to learn more about the world. 2. Generates code to execute these actions. 3. Saves these actions to be retrieved later as part of a long-term memory system.,"Agents can acquire new skills and navigate open-world environments, applicable to real-world tasks requiring lifelong learning.","Lifelong learning, open-world exploration, skill acquisition.","Voyager is an AI pattern designed to enable agents to acquire new skills and explore complex, open-world environments through self-directed learning. It operates by autonomously proposing tasks, generating code to execute actions, and saving these actions into a long-term memory system. This allows agents to continuously learn and navigate open-ended environments, making it suitable for real-world tasks requiring lifelong skill acquisition."
