3412798047066,0.014860200695693493,0.025323547422885895,-0.0038315930869430304,0.00822993740439415,0.008235014043748379,0.0021001873537898064,0.0069688414223492146,-0.009892445988953114,-0.03198014572262764,-0.03084213100373745,0.00884994026273489,-0.016748594120144844,-0.009689598344266415,-0.005412240047007799,0.01491810753941536,0.031089384108781815,0.03065689653158188,-0.025170259177684784,DemonstrateSearchPredict (DSP),"Solving complex questions by decomposing them, searching for answers, and combining responses.",When a question requires multiple steps of information retrieval and synthesis.,"First decomposes a question into sub-questions. Then, uses queries to solve them and combine their responses in a final answer. Uses fewshot prompting to decompose the problem and combine responses.","Effectively solves knowledge-intensive, multi-step questions.","Multi-hop question answering, complex information synthesis.","DemonstrateSearchPredict (DSP) is an AI pattern designed to tackle complex, multi-step questions by first decomposing them into smaller sub-questions. It then uses queries to find answers for these individual parts, employing few-shot prompting to guide both the decomposition and the final synthesis of responses. This method effectively solves knowledge-intensive problems that require multiple steps of information retrieval and synthesis."
