6784234047,0.020088836550712585,-0.02873518131673336,0.00809934176504612,0.0076130712404847145,0.0008521473500877619,0.004514665342867374,0.005738225299865007,-0.034941431134939194,-0.010130573995411396,0.0036442733835428953,-0.03159806877374649,-0.0015134378336369991,-0.0037718305829912424,0.008258972316980362,0.019247740507125854,0.037518613040447235,-0.0286207627505064,Interleaved Retrieval guided by ChainofThought (IRCoT),Improving multi-hop question answering by dynamically guiding retrieval with CoT and vice-versa.,"When multi-hop questions require both reasoning and retrieval, and their interplay is crucial.",Interleaves CoT and retrieval. IRCoT leverages CoT to guide which documents to retrieve and retrieval to help plan the reasoning steps of CoT.,Enhances performance in multi-hop question answering by creating a synergistic relationship between reasoning and retrieval.,"Multi-hop question answering, complex information retrieval and synthesis.","Interleaved Retrieval guided by Chain-of-Thought (IRCoT) is an AI pattern designed to improve multi-hop question answering where complex reasoning and dynamic information retrieval are both essential. It achieves this by interleaving Chain-of-Thought (CoT) reasoning with retrieval, allowing CoT to guide document selection while retrieved information informs and refines the CoT's reasoning steps. This synergistic relationship between reasoning and retrieval significantly enhances performance in tasks requiring complex information synthesis."
