029223777819424868,0.011987266130745411,0.013746458105742931,0.026051461696624756,-0.006863187532871962,0.011731063015758991,-0.008175273425877094,0.006260790396481752,0.01444231066852808,0.004510509315878153,-0.026797616854310036,-0.019583571702241898,0.019037697464227676,-0.006878569722175598,-0.008734111674129963,0.004440727178007364,-0.00119278475176543,0.017232654616236687,0.021414196118712425,-0.03154594451189041,ChatEval Framework,Improving LLM-based evaluation through a multi-agent debate framework.,"When a more robust and nuanced evaluation is needed, simulating human-like debate and diverse perspectives.","Uses a multi-agent debate framework, with each agent having a separate role (e.g., different evaluative personas).",Provides more comprehensive and robust evaluations by simulating a debate among different AI personas.,"Advanced LLM evaluation, simulating human debate, multi-perspective assessment.","The ChatEval Framework is an Agentic AI pattern designed to provide more robust and nuanced LLM evaluations. It achieves this by employing a multi-agent debate framework where each agent adopts a distinct evaluative persona or role. This simulation of diverse perspectives leads to more comprehensive and reliable assessments, mimicking human-like debate."
