1114708837121725,0.0009863278828561306,0.018622083589434624,-0.014939092099666595,0.004567926749587059,0.013714555650949478,-0.0115895327180624,0.004752978682518005,-0.015681782737374306,-0.021084224805235863,-0.024489499628543854,0.0029835833702236414,-0.01773436740040779,0.0013719717971980572,-0.006811699829995632,0.002814772306010127,0.028759565204381943,0.028709735721349716,-0.023581698536872864,Selecting Balanced Demonstrations (for bias mitigation),"Reducing biases in LLM outputs, particularly in FewShot settings.","When using FewShot Prompting, and the distribution of exemplars might introduce or amplify biases.",Select balanced demonstrations or obtain demonstrations optimized over fairness metrics.,Can reduce biases in LLM outputs by providing a fair representation in exemplars.,"Bias mitigation in FewShot learning, fair content generation.","""Selecting Balanced Demonstrations"" is an AI pattern designed to reduce biases in Large Language Model outputs, particularly when using FewShot Prompting. It addresses the problem of exemplar distributions potentially introducing or amplifying biases by advocating for the selection of balanced demonstrations or those optimized over fairness metrics. This method effectively mitigates bias by providing a fair representation in the exemplars, leading to more equitable content generation."
