997362598776817,0.021286770701408386,0.018105871975421906,-0.002655806252732873,0.018799761310219765,0.005323225166648626,0.002643379382789135,-0.0014047977747395635,0.0034839287400245667,-0.0028614597395062447,0.0023599981795996428,-0.02848549373447895,-0.01851046271622181,0.0014166741166263819,-0.0170876607298851,0.003973143640905619,-0.01840171590447426,-0.008351287804543972,0.011586970649659634,0.03261642903089523,-0.02262258157134056,Cultural Awareness (for cultural adaptation),Helping LLMs with cultural adaptation in their outputs.,When LLM outputs need to be culturally relevant or sensitive for specific audiences.,"Inject cultural awareness into prompts. This can be done by creating several prompts with machine translation, including 1. asking the LLM to refine its own output and 2. instructing the LLM to use culturally relevant words.",Enables LLMs to produce culturally adapted and appropriate outputs.,"Culturally sensitive content generation, localized communication.","The ""Cultural Awareness"" pattern helps Large Language Models (LLMs) produce outputs that are culturally relevant and sensitive for specific audiences. It achieves this by injecting cultural awareness directly into prompts, often through iterative refinement or explicit instructions to use culturally appropriate language. This method enables LLMs to generate content that is well-adapted for localized communication and culturally sensitive applications."
