011558015830814838,0.01935669779777527,0.01383994147181511,0.001997672487050295,0.014742388390004635,-0.005564884748309851,0.006283293943852186,0.0027135517448186874,0.016410324722528458,0.010394505225121975,-0.006921962834894657,-0.015823211520910263,-0.021250713616609573,0.009069071151316166,-0.01992916874587536,0.008791085332632065,-0.004258148837834597,-0.006057313177734613,0.022219398990273476,0.03528889641165733,-0.029020853340625763,Question Clarification,Resolving ambiguity in questions by allowing the LLM to identify and ask clarifying questions.,"When a user's question is ambiguous, and the LLM needs more information to provide an accurate answer.","Allows the LLM to identify ambiguous questions and generate clarifying questions to pose to the user. Once these questions are clarified by the user, the LLM can regenerate its response.","Resolves ambiguity, leading to more accurate and contextually appropriate answers.","Ambiguity resolution, interactive problem-solving, improving user experience.","The ""Question Clarification"" pattern addresses ambiguous user questions by allowing the LLM to identify areas needing more information. It enables the LLM to generate and pose clarifying questions to the user, gathering necessary details. Once clarified, the LLM can regenerate its response, leading to more accurate and contextually appropriate answers."
