44,0.010197936557233334,-0.006829105317592621,0.02292526885867119,-0.00925006065517664,0.017876867204904556,-0.009202022105455399,0.012190766632556915,0.006943151820451021,-0.020730910822749138,-0.016775932163000107,-0.020197536796331406,-0.0001347380894003436,-0.00823852140456438,0.005134018138051033,-0.015199811197817326,0.0015941292513161898,0.03025844506919384,0.03778428956866264,-0.009571480564773083,Prompt Modifiers,Changing the resultant image or other multimodal output in a specific way.,"When generating images, videos, or other multimodal content, and fine-grained control over specific attributes (e.g., medium, lighting) is desired.","Append specific words or phrases to a prompt to modify the output. Examples include 'Medium (e.g., on canvas)' or 'Lighting (e.g., a well lit scene)'.","The generated multimodal output incorporates the specified modifications, allowing for more precise control over the creative process.","Image generation, video generation, multimodal content creation, artistic control.","Prompt Modifiers are an AI pattern used to achieve specific, fine-grained changes in generated images, videos, or other multimodal content. This is done by appending particular words or phrases, such as ""on canvas"" for medium or ""a well lit scene"" for lighting, directly to the initial prompt. The pattern thus enables more precise control over the creative process, ensuring the generated output incorporates the desired modifications."
