09563,0.013894275762140751,0.008441501297056675,0.029148748144507408,-0.00961379986256361,0.010108142159879208,0.0038673437666147947,0.005791940726339817,0.011549503542482853,0.00238957442343235,-0.032918304204940796,-0.020450348034501076,0.006276898551732302,-0.024986762553453445,0.008306809701025486,-0.018904706463217735,-0.0074641043320298195,0.032350048422813416,0.03726192191243172,-0.019413765519857407,Pretrained Component Integration (Retriever & Generator),"Developing complex AI systems from scratch for knowledge-intensive tasks is resource-intensive, time-consuming, and may not leverage the extensive general knowledge already encoded in large pretrained models.","Building hybrid AI systems that combine different functionalities (e.g., retrieval and generation) where high-quality, broadly knowledgeable components already exist from large-scale pretraining efforts.","Initialize the retriever component with a pretrained neural retriever (e.g., DPR, which is a bi-encoder trained to retrieve documents containing answers to QA questions) and the generator component with a pretrained seq2seq model (e.g., BART, trained with a denoising objective). These pretrained components are then jointly fine-tuned for the specific downstream task.","Leverages extensive knowledge already present in pretrained models, allowing the system to access knowledge without additional training for the access mechanisms, and achieving strong performance with less task-specific pretraining. This approach unifies previous successes in incorporating retrieval into individual tasks.","Building efficient and high-performing hybrid AI systems for knowledge-intensive NLP, reducing development time and computational cost.","This pattern, ""Pretrained Component Integration (Retriever & Generator),"" describes building complex AI systems by combining separately pretrained components. It initializes a neural retriever (like DPR) and a sequence-to-sequence generator (like BART) with their extensive existing knowledge. These components are then jointly fine-tuned for a specific task, efficiently leveraging broad knowledge to achieve high performance with reduced development effort."
